@8604[2]. Man is distinguished from the brutes in that he can look above himself and below himself...

@8995[3]. What is loved is regarded as the end.

@9184[2]. The Lord then draws to Himself all things of life with the man, so that they look upwards.

@9207[6]. (Good and truth) then mutually regard each other... Then they look backwards or behind them. Signified.

