@4952. For a lot awaits everyone according to his life. @5006[end].

@6348[3]. The man with whom profanation takes place has the worst lot of all there. @DP 133[2].

@6959[2]. A harder lot is that of those who profane good...

@7236. All there have a place allotted them according to the quality of their good...

@7398[2]. After falsities are removed, their places are allotted elsewhere in the Natural.

@7681[2]. Then the Hells... are allotted places according to the quality of their evil.

@10287[14]. To "cast a lot upon Jerusalem" (Obadiah 1:11) = to destroy the Church, and to dissipate its truths. @AE 811[16].

@10818. These can have no lot with the Angels.

@HH 360. They are indignant because happinesses above others are not allotted them.

@361. The lot of the rich in Heaven... @362.

@364. Among the poor are very many who are not content with their lot... It is very different with the poor who are content with their lot...

@386[end]. Such a lot awaits adulterers...

@393[end]. Such have no lot in Heaven.

@DLife 63[3]. A different lot have they who...

@DLW 13. Each nation there is allotted a place according to the idea of God as a Man...

@200[2]. Such forces get activities from the sun...

@DP 179. Trust is given them that the Lord disposes their lot.

@--[2]. Most after death want to know their lot; but they are answered that if they have lived well their lot is in Heaven; if evilly, in Hell.

@185. As they then manifestly see... their lot, which is that they will come into Hell...

@203. Every man... is allotted a place in Heaven or Hell according to his life.

@305. I heard many complaining that they had not known that the lot of their life would be according to the affections of their love...

@AR 153. A relation concerning the lot of those... who have confirmed themselves in faith alone... @TCR 281.

@611[3]. Hence it may be seen what is the lot of those who account truths as nothing. @TCR 622[3].

@CL 505. On the lot of (deflowerers).

@510. On the lot of (those in the lust of varieties).

@512. On the lot of (those in the lust of violation).

@514. On the lot of (the seducers of innocences).

@ISB 19[5]. (A drawing of lots decided by Providence.) @TCR 696[2].

@TCR 276[end]. What kind of a lot awaits these after death. Explained.

@536[3]. Such a lot have they who do not the works of charity from religion...

@568. What pious and wise man does not want to know the lot of his life after death? Explained.

@SE 2513. See <Content>. @5790. a.

@3206[2]. Few (Sirens) are of the lower sort.

@AE 376[24]. To "cast a lot" (Joel 3:3) = to dissipate.

@652[26]. To "cast a lot upon them" (Nahum 3:10) = to be dissipated.

@727[15]. "Upon the lot of the just" (Psalms 125:3) = upon the truths from good which are with... those who are in love to the Lord.

@863[10]. To "cast a lot upon the people" (Joel 3:3) = to disperse the truths of the Church by means of falsities.

@CanonsNC 44. Trinity. 7. 7. Everyone is allotted a place in the Societies of Heaven according to his idea of God.

